{{!-- Before the waves are painted: mark that the waves script may take over, so the picture starts in the arrangement the canvas will draw (waves.scss: waves-fanned.svg). Only from the reveal's width (48rem, scripts/waves.ts): narrower screens keep the still picture. The script takes the mark off again if it can't run. --}}
<script>if(matchMedia("(min-width: 48rem)").matches)document.documentElement.classList.add("waves-js")</script>
<div class="waves" aria-hidden="true"></div>
